    build: ./frontend
    container_name: attire_react_web
    ports:
      - "80:80"
    depends_on:
      - backend

volumes:
  postgres_data:
  media_volume:
6.2 Security, Performance & Scalability Benchmarks
API Response Speeds: Uncached database queries must resolve in under 200 milliseconds. Static images are compressed via Pillow upon upload to maintain catalog loading speeds under 2 seconds.

CORS Security: Restrict origin requests strictly using django-cors-headers middleware to allowed client domains:

Python
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS = [
    "http://localhost:3000",
    "https://yourdomain.com",
]
Data Protection: User passwords are encrypted using Django’s default PBKDF2 password hasher with a SHA256 footprint. Sensitive JWT tokens are stored client-side in secure state, with access tokens cleared upon session expiry or logout.

Database Backups: Daily automated PostgreSQL database dumps scheduled via Cron utilities to guarantee reliable system disaster recovery.